            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", as well as the bounded linear functional "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "expression": "L"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". By leveraging these properties, Céa's Lemma ensures that the finite element solution converges to the true solution under appropriate conditions, such as continuity of the bilinear form "
