              "type": "citation_occurrence",
              "occurrence_id": "d3efa947-2a38-5ee1-a4e3-e8a3210f0cc5",
              "source_id": "wiki_babu_ka_lax_milgram_theorem"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". The finite element procedure relies on these conditions to converge to the true solution, as demonstrated by Céa's Lemma, which relates the exact solution of a variational problem to its finite-dimensional approximation "
